. The company was founded in 1980 by Mr. Suresh Raheja, and since then established a strong reputation for creating high-quality residential and commercial properties.\nOver the years, Raheja Universal has completed numerous projects in prime locations across Mumbai, including Worli, Bandra, Khar, and Malad, among others. The company's portfolio includes luxury apartments, villas, townships, and commercial spaces, including Raheja Chromium, Raheja Titanium, Raheja Plaza, Stanchart Tower, and others.\nRaheja Universal is known for its commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability. The company uses cutting-edge technology and the latest construction techniques to deliver world-class projects that meet the needs of modern buyers. They also focus on eco-friendly practices and design their projects to be energy-efficient and environment-friendly.\nThe company has won several awards and accolades for its outstanding work. They pride themselves on completing over 53 projects totalling approximately 8.34 million square feet of real estate in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region (MMR). With a strong focus on customer satisfaction, Raheja Universal strives to exceed expectations and deliver the best possible real estate solutions to its clients.\n\n![Raheja Exotica Cyprus residential project in Madh](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-raheja-exotica-cyprus-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMadh, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.72 Cr to 6.74 Cr\n\n![Raheja Exotica Siena residential project in Madh](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-raheja-exotica-siena-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMadh, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.00 Cr to 1.83 Cr\n\n![Raheja Exotica Verona residential project in Madh](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-raheja-exotica-verona-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMadh, Mumbai\n\n