230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.99 Cr to 2.11 Cr\n\n![Modispaces Nile residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/modispaces-nile-project-project-large-image1-8451.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.47 Cr to 3.60 Cr\n\n![Mayfair Sardar Smruti CHS residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mayfair-sardar-smruti-chs-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Mayfair 14 residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mayfair-14-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Retail Shop, Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Rustomjee Reserve residential project in Dahisar West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rustomjee-reserve-project-project-large-image1-1286.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nDahisar West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.60 Cr to 4.30 Cr\n\n![Mayfair Shyam residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mayfair-shyam-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.60 Cr to 2.27 Cr\n\n![Mayfair Housing Shyam residential project in Kandivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mayfair-housing-shyam-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.76 Cr to 2.53 Cr\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Raheja Green\n\n### What are the popular amenities available at Raheja Green?\n\nResidents of Raheja Green can enjoy amenities such as Kids' Play Areas / Sand Pits, Power Backup, 24\\*7 Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Normal Park / Central Green, designed for comfort and a modern lifestyle.\n\n### Can I visit the actual flat at Raheja Green before buying?\n\nYes, since Raheja Green is a Ready to Move project in Borivali East, buyers can arrange site visits and inspect the actual apartment before finalizing the deal.\n\n### Who is the developer of Raheja Green?\n\nRaheja Green is developed by Raheja Universal, a reputed developer with 39 years of experience and 67 completed projects.\n\n### Does Raheja Green have an Occupancy Certificate (OC)\n\nYes, Raheja Green has received its Occupancy Certificate, confirming that the project is legally approved for residential use\n\n### What is the locality price trend around Raheja Green?\n\nThe average asking price in Borivali East is ₹ 34,750 /Sq.Ft., while the micromarket average asking price is ₹ 35,900 /Sq.Ft..\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.aurumproptech.in/pulse/properties/mumbai/borivali-east/raheja-builders-green-park-1540170","title":"Raheja Builders Green Park in Borivali East, Mumbai | Price, Floor Plans & Amenities","raw_content":"New Launch - India Real Estate Report 2026.\n\n[![pulse logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2FPropTech_Pulse_logo.png&w=1200&q=75)](/pulse)\n\nKnowledge Hub\n\n![pulse logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2FPropTech_Pulse_logo.webp&w=1200&q=75)\n\nAsk Pulse Ai\n\nServices\n\nFOR BUYERS & RENTERS\n\n[Explore verified properties across cities](/pulse/properties)[Home Loan\n\nLow-interest loans with expert support](/pulse/aurum-kuberx)[Packers & Movers\n\nReliable relocation with trusted partners](/pulse/packers-and-movers)[Interior Designing\n\nDesigns tailored to your space](/pulse/interior-design-service)\n\nFOR REAL ESTATE DEVELOPERS\n\n[Pulse 3D\n\nAR/VR consultations, made simple.](/pulse/ar-vr)[Voice AI\n\n24/7 AI voice agent for property queries](/pulse/ai-voice-agent)\n\n![coin top](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcoin_top.7e5fd71f.webp&w=640&q=75)![coin top](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fleft_coin.3256e886.webp&w=640&q=75)\n\n![kuberx](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fkuberx_logo.b474934e.webp&w=640&q=75)\n\n## EARN UPTO ₹80,000\n\nOn every loan disbursed\n\n![Kuberx ad QR](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fqr_code.9481ebef.webp&w=640&q=75)\n\n![Kuberx ad hand](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FHand_logo.3b301075.webp&w=640&q=75)![coin bottom](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcoin_bottom.d603a4e4.webp&w=640&q=75)![coin top](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fright_coin.9484f36b.webp&w=640&q=75)\n\nKnowledge Hub\n\nLEARN\n\n[Pulse AI\n\nIndia’s AI-First Real Estate Intelligence Platform](/pulse/pulse-ai)[Pulse university\n\nLearn & earn knowledge](/pulse/courses)\n\nBLOGS & MEDIA\n\n[Web Stories\n\nView bite-sized property stories](/pulse/web-stories)[Daily Pulse\n\nGet real estate news updates](/pulse/media)[Insight Pulse\n\nRead blogs on real estate](/pulse/blogs)[Quick Pulse\n\nWatch trending property reels](/pulse/video)\n\nDISCOVER\n\n[Newsletters\n\nReceive curated real estate updates](/pulse/newsletters)[Infographics\n\nView real estate data with visuals](/pulse/infographics)[Reports\n\nAccess detailed property market studies](/pulse/reports)\n\nResources\n\nINDUSTRY\n\n[Pulse Events\n\nExplore upcoming events and networking](/pulse/events)[Company Insights\n\nDiscover business insights](/pulse/company-insight)\n\nGUIDES\n\n[City & Locality\n\nExplore Cities & Localities](/pulse/localities)[Indian Pincodes Guide\n\nGet Information on Indian Pincodes](/pulse/pincode)[Home Ownership Guide\n\nHow to Buy a Home](/pulse/properties/how-to-buy)[Stamp Duty Guide\n\nLearn property charges and rates](/pulse/stamp-duty)[Home Loan Banks\n\nHome loan banks list](/pulse/home-loan)\n\nHELP\n\n[Glossary\n\nUnderstand simple real estate terms](/pulse/glossary)[FAQs\n\nQuick answers to common queries](/pulse/faqs)\n\nTools\n\nPROPERTY\n\n[Rates and Trends\n\nTrack latest market rates and shifts](/pulse/tools/rates-and-trends)[RERA Search\n\nFind verified real estate project data](/pulse/rera)[Circle Rate Calculator\n\nCalculate property circle rate instantly](/pulse/tools/circleRateCalculator)[Stamp Duty Calculator\n\nEstimate property stamp duty quickly](/pulse/tools/stampDutyCalculator)\n\nLOAN & FINANCE\n\n[CIBIL Tracker\n\nKnow your cibil score in seconds](/pulse/tools/cibil-score)[Eligibility Calculator\n\nCheck eligibility criteria](/pulse/tools/eligibility-calculator)[Home Loan EMI Calculator\n\nCheck EMI before buying property](/pulse/tools/home-loan-emi-calculator)[Loan Transfer Calculator\n\nSave money by transferring loans](/pulse/tools/loan-transfer-calculator)[SIP Calculator\n\nCompare and analyze SIP returns](/pulse/tools/sip)\n\nUTILITY TOOLS\n\n[Rent Receipt Generator\n\nGenerate monthly property rent receipt](/pulse/tools/rent-receipt-generator)[Unit Converter\n\nConvert land measurements across units](/pulse/unit-converters)[Rental Yield Calculator\n\nCalculate property rental yield returns](/pulse/tools/rental-yield-calculator)\n\n©PropTech Pulse 2025, All rights reserved.\n\n[![Proptiger Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2Fassets%2Fexclusive-properties%2Flogo-proptiger.png&w=640&q=75)](/pulse/properties)\n\n[![Home](/frontend/assets/pulse/home-icon.svg)](/pulse)[Properties](/pulse/properties)[Apart...](/pulse/properties/mumbai)[Green Park](/pulse/properties/mumbai/borivali-east/raheja-builders-green-park-1540170)\n\n![gallery/1-102021539](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fim.proptiger.com%2F1%2F1%2F6%2F102021539.png&w=1200&q=60)\n\n1 Images\n\nCompleted\n\nPossession : Oct 2003\n\n# Green Park\n\nCompleted\n\nPossession : Oct 2003\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\nByRaheja Builders\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 BHK\n\nBuiltup area\n\n1,080 sq ft\n\nAvg. Price\n\n20.0K/sq.ft\n\nPossession Status\n\nCompleted\n\n## Overview\n\nPossession Start Date\n\nOctober 2003\n\nLaunch Date\n\nApril 2000\n\nStatus\n\nCompleted\n\nTotal Launched Apartments\n\n50\n\nAvailability\n\nSold Out\n\nExciting offers\n\n3 & 4 BHK 36 months Pre EMI Holiday\n\n![Exciting Offer](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2Fassets%2Fexclusive-properties%2Fgift.png&w=640&q=75)\n\n## Green ParkNeighbourhood\n\nCommute\n\nHealthcare\n\nEducation\n\nShopping\n\nTheatres\n\nSanjay Gandhi Udyan (National Park)\n\n0.31 Km\n\nNational Park\n\n0.32 Km\n\nSanjay Gandhi Udyan (National Park)\n\n0.36 Km\n\nNational Park Gate\n\n0.37 Km\n\nDevi Pada\n\n0.37 Km\n\n## About Raheja Builders\n\n![Developer Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2Fassets%2Fexclusive-properties%2FdummyImg.png&w=1200&q=75)\n\nTotal Projects\n\n17\n\n..\n\n## More projects by Raheja Builders\n\n![Panchavati 1](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fim.proptiger.com%2F1%2F1%2F6%2F102021539.png&w=1200&q=75)\n\nCompleted\n\nPossession : Nov 2000\n\nPanchavati 1\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nPrice: N.A3 BHK Apartment\n\n![Garden CHS](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fim.proptiger.com%2F1%2F1%2F6%2F102021539.png&w=1200&q=75)\n\nCompleted\n\nPossession : Aug 2003\n\nGarden CHS\n\nThane West, Mumbai\n\nPrice: N.A4 BHK Apartment\n\n![Complex](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fim.proptiger.com%2F1%2F675511%2F6%2F39921751.jpeg&w=1200&q=75)\n\nCompleted\n\nPossession : Dec 2014\n\nThane West, Mumbai\n\nPrice: N.A2 BHK Apartment\n\n[![PropTigerLogo](/frontend/commonAssets/PropTiger/logo-proptiger.png)](#home)\n\n#### OUR SOLUTIONS\n\n[Aurum RealEstate](https://aurumrealestate.in/)[Aurum Analytica](https://www.aurumanalytica.in/)[Aurum Prive](https://www.aurumprive.in/)\n\n#### PARTNER SOLUTIONS\n\n[HelloWorld](https://thehelloworld.com/)[Nestaway](https://www.nestaway.com/)[Sell.Do](https://www.sell.do)[PropTiger](https://www.proptiger.com/)[Monkspaces.ai](https://monkspaces.ai/)[KuberX](https://www.aurumproptech.in/pulse/aurum-kuberx)[AMSA](https://amsainvestments.in)\n\n#### RESOURCES\n\nGet in touch\n\n[Blogs](/pulse/blogs)[FAQs](/pulse/faqs)[Privacy Policy](/pulse/privacy-policy)[Terms and Conditions](/pulse/terms-of-use)\n\n#### COMMUNITY\n\n[Whatsapp](https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VagmyZd8fewjAamOYr2A)[Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/aurumproptech)[Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/AurumPropTech)[Youtube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8FtpXTHwqaYBMyx4YNnOxQ)\n\n#### REACH US\n\nBatra House, Plot No. 52, Institutional Area, Sector 32, Gurugram, Haryana, 122003\n\n[1800-103-104-1](callto:1800-103-104-1)\n\nMade with Love\n\n![Statue](/frontend/assets/aurum-kuberx/flag.webp)\n\nThe information provided on this page is collated from publicly available resources. PropTech Pulse does not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, or authority of this data and shall not be held liable for any discrepancies. For queries or further assistance, please contact us at[pulse@aurumproptech.in](mailto:pulse@aurumproptech.in)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/raheja-park-west/158893/project","title":"Raheja Park West, Santacruz West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹10.50 Cr Onwards | 3, 4 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![R Raheja Properties developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/r-raheja-properties-15770.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Raheja Park West Santacruz West, Mumbai\n\n![Raheja Park West Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/raheja-park-west-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Raheja Park West Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/raheja-park-west-project-amenities-features1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Raheja Park West Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/raheja-park-west-project-amenities-features4.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Raheja Park West Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-raheja-park-west-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹10.50 Cr - 14.81 Cr**\n\n₹47,300 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Raheja Park West?\n\n## About Raheja Park West, Santacruz West by R Raheja Properties\n\nRaheja Park West, located in the prime location of Santacruz West, is a premier residential project that offers a luxurious living experience. Strategically situated at the heart of the city, the project enjoys excellent connectivity to major roads like Swami Vivekanand Road, Link Road, and Western Express Highway, making it easily accessible from all directions.\n\nThe project boasts of a range of world-class amenities, including a gymnasium, to cater to the diverse needs of its residents. Moreover, the property ensures a seamless living experience with its reliable power backup system. For those who value comfort and luxury, Raheja Park West is the perfect choice.\n\nThe project offers a range of spacious units, including 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments, each meticulously designed to provide a comfortable and luxurious living experience. With a range of unit options available, starting from 1228 Sq. Ft. to 1732 Sq. Ft, there s something for everyone at Raheja Park West. Prices start at 9.40 Cr for the 3 BHK apartments and 13.26 Cr for the 4 BHK apartments.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Raheja Park West:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1228 | 9.40 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1383 | 10.59 Cr |\n| 4 BHK Apartment | 1732 | 13.26 Cr |\n\nThe latest real estate project is situated near several notable landmarks, offering residents a unique blend of convenience, comfort, and modern living. These landmarks not only enhance the quality of life for residents but also provide easy access to essential amenities and services.\n\n## Raheja Park West Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Raheja Park West.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1228 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 10.50 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1383 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 11.83 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1732 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 14.81 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nRaheja Park West's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Santacruz West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Raheja Park West | Santacruz West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 47300 | 57450 |\n| Mar 2026 | 45900 | 56950 |\n| Dec 2025 | 44400 | 57050 |\n| Sep 2025 | 42200 | 54850 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nRaheja Park West avg. price is ₹ 47.3 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Santacruz West at ₹ 57.5 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Ekta Evaana](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ekta-evaana/237806/project \"Ekta Evaana\") | ₹ 75,000 |\n| [DLH Dawn](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/dlh-dawn/246836/project \"DLH Dawn\") | ₹ 72,400 |\n| [Kalpataru Amare](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-amare/247887/project \"Kalpataru Amare\") | ₹ 60,950 |\n| Santacruz West | ₹ 57,450 |\n| Current Project **Raheja Park West** | ₹ 47,300 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Santacruz West ranges from ₹ 58 K to ₹ 3.1 L with options available for 1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Raheja Park West | In Santacruz West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 58 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 1.4 L |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 2.1 L |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 3.1 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Raheja Park West.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nA total of 4 residential transactions has been registered so far for Raheja Park West, amounting to ₹ 46 Cr till September 2026.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Raheja Park West moved from ₹ 45,900/sqft to ₹ 47,300/sqft, reflecting a 3.05% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Raheja Park West moved from ₹ 44,400/sqft to ₹ 45,900/sqft, reflecting a 3.38% rise.\n\nA total of 2 out of 78 launched units have been booked as of February 2026, including 8% of 3 BHK B 1(1 out of 13 units), 8% of 3 BHK B 2(1 out of 13 units).\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Raheja Park West moved from ₹ 42,200/sqft to ₹ 44,400/sqft, reflecting a 5.21% rise.\n\nExternal Works has reached 90%, Internal finishing stands at 40%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 90% done.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n4 Sales Transactions Registered in Raheja Park West From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 44.4 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | ₹ 46 Cr | ₹ 44,400 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Raheja Park West Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1228 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Raheja Park West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/raheja-park-west-apartment-3-bhk-1228sqft-20220328110349.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 10.50 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1383 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Raheja Park West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/raheja-park-west-apartment-3-bhk-1383sqft-20220428110423.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 11.83 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 4 BHK 1732 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Raheja Park West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/raheja-park-west-apartment-4-bhk-1732sqft-20220428110451.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 14.81 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Raheja Park West\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Raheja Park West to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Raheja Park West Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/raheja-park-west-project-amenities-features1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Raheja Park West Amenities-Features](http